flowchart TD
  A[Dispatch Request] --> B[Authenticate and Authorize]
  B --> C[Validate DTO with Zod]
  C --> D[Open Transaction]
  D --> E[Lock Vehicle Row]
  E --> F[Lock Pickup Rows]
  F --> G{Capacity and Status Valid?}
  G -- No --> H[Rollback and Return Conflict]
  G -- Yes --> I[Assign Pickups and Update Vehicle Load]
  I --> J[Write Audit Log]
  J --> K[Commit and Return Response]
